+Staff may set `open`, `pending`, or `solved`. They can also set priority with
+`{"ticket":{"priority":"high"}}` (or `"normal"`), alone or alongside a status,
+assignment, or comment. Invalid priority values roll back the entire update.
+Priority is never included in customer request responses or writable by customers.
+
+A staff reply without a status leaves the current status unchanged. Customers use
+the `request` envelope, may set `open`
 or `solved`, and their replies reopen pending or solved requests unless the same
 update explicitly sets `solved`. Invalid comments or statuses roll back the whole
 update. Requester, author, and account cannot be changed through these endpoints.
@@ -148,14 +154,30 @@ Comments contain `id`, `body`, `author: {"id":…, "name":…}`, `public`, and
